# Title: Potential Persistence Using DebugPath
# ID: df4dc653-1029-47ba-8231-3c44238cc0ae
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-07-27
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.015
# Description: Detects potential persistence using Appx DebugPath
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((registry_key_name="*Classes\\ActivatableClasses\\Package\\Microsoft.*" AND registry_key_name="*\\DebugPath") OR (registry_key_name="*\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PackagedAppXDebug\\Microsoft.*" AND registry_key_name="*\\(Default)"))
